Chapter: WorldSpawnOutfitData
  cites Uoaix chapter CharacterStylist

 Modified UOX3 NPC outfit data, GPL-2.0-or-later.
 Copyright 1997, 98 Marcus Rating (Cironian); see the retained UOX3 license.
 Source and limitations: WorldSpawns.md. License: ports/UOX3-LICENSE.txt.
  wso-keep : List CstRow, Integer, List CstRow -> List CstRow
  wso-keep (rows) (i) (out) = if i == list-length rows then out
    else let row = list-at rows i in wso-keep rows (i + 1) (if row.graphic == 0 then out else list-push out row)
  wso-p80-0 : Integer -> CstRow
  wso-p80-0 (serial) = let c = cst-pick serial 100 9 in let hue = 1102 + cst-pick serial 200 47 in if c < 1 then cst-row 8262 hue 11 else if c < 2 then cst-row 8252 hue 11 else if c < 3 then cst-row 8260 hue 11 else if c < 4 then cst-row 8261 hue 11 else if c < 5 then cst-row 8253 hue 11 else if c < 6 then cst-row 8264 hue 11 else if c < 7 then cst-row 8251 hue 11 else if c < 8 then cst-row 8265 hue 11 else cst-row 8266 hue 11
